# Scratch full-text dumps. Scoped to out/ deliberately: a blanket *.txt would
# silently swallow LICENSE.txt / NOTICE.txt / CITATION.txt and ship a repo
# missing them, with `git add` reporting nothing.
out/
*-fulltext.txt

# local tool downloads (cloudflared)
.tools/
